Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:56.67,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\fad(600,0)\1c&H041871&\3c&H69E3F7&\bord5\fn方正大黑_GBK\pos(971.415,836)}奖励确定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs125\1c&H34282E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord5\fn@汉仪正圆-65S\frz270\move(252.8,846.4,-288.585,523.6,653,861)}有点害羞
