Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:20.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\1c&H1E1C1E&\bord0\fn汉仪正圆-65S\frz24.77\pos(493.784,607.347)}亲爱的阿久津先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:20.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\1c&H1E1C1E&\bord0\fn汉仪正圆-65S\frz24.77\pos(514.584,732.147)}因安全的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:20.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\1c&H1E1C1E&\bord0\fn汉仪正圆-65S\pos(674.584,797.747)\frz24.44}有件非常想要交给你的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:20.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\1c&H1E1C1E&\bord0\fn汉仪正圆-65S\frz24.44\pos(637.784,952.947)}不是奇怪的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:20.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\1c&H1E1C1E&\bord0\fn汉仪正圆-65S\pos(880.984,840.947)\frz24.52}请务必接收
